        <mxCell id="legend-stack-3-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;one per cloud&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="382" y="1616" width="208" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1810" width="520" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#34d399&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · data plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; On each cloud, Alloy pushes its series to the local WireGuard pod, port 18080, with cluster=aws or gcp.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; The on-prem WireGuard pod relays them through the tunnel to vminsert.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; The on-prem Alloy pushes the hub&amp;#39;s series, cluster=onprem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; OpenCost on-prem prices them at the TCO, reading cluster=&amp;#34;onprem&amp;#34; only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; Every pass, the CMP ingester pulls the allocations per namespace and day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; It reads savings (replicas at 0) and rightsizing data with cluster=~&amp;#34;onprem|&amp;#34;: history before 27/10 has no label.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt; It upserts FOCUS lines; a closed day is never rewritten, a late change becomes an adjustment.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="630" y="1460" width="580" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-bg" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background · control plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; The on-prem pod opens the tunnel, UDP 31820 to the cloud node. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; Reads (18083) reach vmselect the same way, today for Argo Rollouts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; Planned (Cloud#36): the cloud OpenCost reads its own cluster&amp;#39;s series over 18083.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; Missing: the CMP would read the cloud OpenCost through aws-apps / gcp-apps :18081.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt; Carbon intensity from RTE. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;G&lt;/span&gt; Planned: the AWS and GCP invoices, behind finops_enabled.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1240" y="1460" width="480" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-tunnel" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fbbf24&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Tunnel ports&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;18080&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; cloud → vminsert, metrics. Allowed: observability.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;18082&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; cloud → Loki, logs. Allowed: observability.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;18083&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; cloud → vmselect, reads. Allowed: argo-rollouts, finops (Cloud#36).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;18081&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; on-prem → cloud, still whoami.&lt;br&gt;• socat relays on both ends: nothing else crosses.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="1460" width="350" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G21&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;On-prem only advice.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; No savings or rightsizing for apps on EKS / GKE yet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G22&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Stale tunnel diagram.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; multicloud-links predates CNP-110.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G23&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Port 18081.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Still whoami: the CMP cannot read the cloud OpenCost.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
